      "title": "CMSINFO: Board Actions And Dividend Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their price target on CMS Info Systems steady at ₹389, reflecting unchanged assumptions on fair value, discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E, with no new Street research driving a different view. What's in the News A board meeting will be held on February 12, 2026 to review the unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2025, and to consider an interim dividend and a postal ballot notice for an independent director appointment (Key Developments).",
