      "title": "CMSINFO: Long-Term SBI ATM Mandate Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their fair value estimate for CMS Info Systems steady at ₹389, reflecting unchanged assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E for now. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for February 12, 2026 to consider and approve unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2025, consider an interim dividend for FY 2025-26, and approve a postal ballot notice for an independent director appointment (company filing).",
