      "title": "CMSINFO: SBI ATM Outsourcing Mandate Will Support Long-Term Upside",
      "body": "The analyst price target for CMS Info Systems has been revised from ₹432.20 to ₹389.00, with analysts citing a lower assumed future P/E multiple, while keeping long term growth and margin assumptions broadly unchanged. What's in the News CMS Info Systems received a ₹10,000m, 10 year contract from State Bank of India to manage 5,000 bank owned ATMs across India, covering managed services and cash efficiency initiatives starting January 2026 (Key Developments).",
