      "title": "CMSINFO: Long-Term SBI ATM Contract Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have revised their price target on CMS Info Systems from ₹466 to ₹432.20, reflecting updated assumptions around fair value, a slightly different discount rate, modestly adjusted revenue growth expectations, and a lower future P/E multiple, partly offset by a marginally higher profit margin outlook. What's in the News CMS Info Systems has been awarded a ₹10,000 million, 10-year contract from State Bank of India to manage 5,000 bank-owned ATMs across India, covering cash management, managed services and higher ATM uptime, with the contract going live in January 2026.",
